- `getSetupStatus(): Promise<{checks: DoctorCheck[]}>` with validation.
- `startPreview(): Promise<{started:boolean}>`, `stopPreview(): Promise<{stopped:boolean}>`.
- Bridge types.

Use contracts types? Preload uses local interfaces. Add:
```ts
interface DoctorCheck { id:'node'|...; label:string; status:'pass'|'warn'|'fail'|'skip'; detail:string }
interface SetupStatus { checks: DoctorCheck[] }
```
Validator:
```ts
function readSetupStatus(value): SetupStatus { check object, checks array, each shape }
```
Could be verbose. Keep.

Add methods at top of bridge object after getAppState.

