Now SetupScreen component. Props and rendering. Need type imports from shared/setup and framing.

Design:
```tsx
export interface SetupScreenProps {
  consent: boolean;
  keyStatus: KeyStatus;
  keyDetail: string;
  framing: FramingChecks;
  framingHint: string | null;
  preview: PreviewStatus;
