.camera-frame { position:relative; display:inline-block; max-width:100%; }
.framing-guide { position:absolute; inset:0; pointer-events:none; }
.face-outline { position:absolute; left:50%; top:12%; width:34%; aspect-ratio:3/4; transform:translateX(-50%); border:2px dashed rgba(...); border-radius:50%; }
.chest-line { position:absolute; left:14%; right:14%; bottom:18%; border-top:2px dashed ...; }
```
Use existing vars; dashed border color `var(--muted)` but in mirrored canvas? Overlay should not mirror, and canvas is mirrored via transform; overlay outside canvas. Good.
- `.camera-frame` width min(420px,100%), aspect ratio 4/3; canvas width 100% height 100%? Current `.camera-video` has width min and aspect ratio. If wrapper inline-block, canvas controls size. Set `.camera-frame { position:relative; width:min(420px,100%); }` `.camera-video { width:100%; }`.
- `.framing-guide` uses rgba; W5 tokens later. Use `border: 2px dashed var(--muted)` and `opacity:.8`. Not color-only meaning (decorative, aria-hidden).
- For no video, previewSlot placeholder.

Create SetupScreen.

